          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fa2c9560e618ad8bce6f585f83e0c5f58091037c19ae3794540f991108bd5f57:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e971f03a975c4c828f8ad43d0f85b42b",
      "statement": "Moderator actions (takedown, suspend, unsuspend) are signed by operator-held keys from config.moderator_keys, mapped at startup from fingerprint to public key. The service verifies over a server-constructed canonical dict mixing body fields with path parameters — {moderator_fingerprint, report_id, reason} for takedown, {moderator_fingerprint, fingerprint, reason} for suspend, {moderator_fingerprint, fingerprint} for unsuspend — raising MODERATOR_UNKNOWN for an unconfigured key and TAKEDOWN_UNAUTHORIZED on verification failure. Agent appeals are signed with the agent's own stored key over the constructed {fingerprint, statement} dict.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/moderation.py#L36-L52",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4c8b9cb69a8d81a9175a10bb5df2178deeb44f24e57c878ab88a7dec46df8f97:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/moderation.py#L54-L121",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6d1687eeb3bfddc0c4d104f64b52da458f9abccfaa676493215350425fe326c5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_75106f623a184bacaa6db716b412a9b9",
      "statement": "validate_manifest enforces the hard rules protecting the signed form in fixed order: manifest must be a dict with format 'haap-public-manifest-v1' and an agent object; agent.fingerprint must match ^HF-[0-9a-f]{16}$; a recursive scan rejects any forbidden field (private_key/signature/nonce) at any depth with FORBIDDEN_FIELD and any float value anywhere with FLOAT_FORBIDDEN, running before endpoint checks so dedicated codes win; agent.endpoint must be http(s) with a host and no query, fragment, or URL credentials (ENDPOINT_INVALID). Validation never mutates the manifest because its canonical bytes must stay identical to what the agent signed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/manifest.py#L1-L16",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1e44951a8d08de6a3214909978474f4ca930d0871f8db8613648aab537716445:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/manifest.py#L30-L101",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:a43485edb1efa2419f9eb02a118b8229ed401624a26f0cef030b91aafb3da3dd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e86dcb2b5e784f6aba18f73f21e9db53",
      "statement": "errors.py's ERROR_STATUS dict is the master add-only contract: it maps every stable UPPER_SNAKE code to a fixed HTTP status (400/403/404/405/409/410/413/422/429/500/503) and is pre-seeded with the reserved L2/L3/L4 codes so the table stays complete as handlers are wired in. Codes are API — never renamed, never removed, add only. DirectoryError(code, message, retry_after) resolves the status from ERROR_STATUS, uses short generic default messages from _DEFAULT_MESSAGES, and to_wire(request_id) renders the envelope {\"error\": {\"code\", \"message\", \"request_id\"}}.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/errors.py#L1-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:76e9bccfa55c044b6fa275f83ebdc97169a75e40bb67162ef20c92014ad058b6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_15b269a48ccc4838ac930c03e71a4fb6",
      "statement": "Error messages never leak internals: handlers raise only stable codes with short generic messages, and any non-DirectoryError exception escaping an HTTP handler (do_POST or the _json_action wrapper) is converted to INTERNAL_ERROR (500) by the HTTP layer, with details confined to server logs. Body-size and parse failures are handled before business logic: bodies over config.max_body_bytes are rejected with PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE before reading, malformed JSON with INVALID_JSON, and valid JSON that is not an object with INVALID_SCHEMA.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/http_api.py#L193-L210",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:50e7d4785db2702007ca8f92e272635c4556e9cc0a8a0edb0e7aceb546471577:"
        },
        {
